1941..2015 Comment "/// A path at every loop whose inverse arm drops its rest\'s path: each arm"
2016..2097 Comment "/// checks at its letter, but at `loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q` the loop arm carries"
2098..2169 Comment "/// the inverse arm\'s reflexivity to `Path.here(loop ∷ back(loop) ∷"
2170..2187 Comment "/// q)`, which is"
2188..2263 Comment "/// not the path at `q` the cancellation\'s right side reads. Read as a set,"
2264..2332 Comment "/// the loops would identify the two; the words are not read as one."
